WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
you look beautiful

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,520
Be smart and please Brother Kun

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,160
He is reluctant to kill you so quickly

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,640
I don’t necessarily want to ask about the quiet rain box on the head in the future.

5
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:08,920
These are the people you have here

6
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,680
So many of us can't satisfy you

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:14,280
How much more big brother do you want?

8
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,040
A group of people came from the north gate

9
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,680
The one with the whole body is very strong

10
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,560
They found us and wanted to save people.

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,040
Why are you provoking them? I'm not provoking them.

12
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,440
They discovered it themselves

13
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,080
They saw dried meat drying in the yard

14
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:30,960
We've already entered Courtyard No. 1. The door is blocked. There's no one to lead the way. They can't get in.

15
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:34,940
It's too late

16
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:43,080
People have come in, Xiao Rourou
